  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways to Engage the Government of Sri Lanka and Supporting Tools to Enhance Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the UK&#x2019;s engagement with Sri Lanka&#x2019;s government by providing thoughtful political analysis and exploring practical tools to enhance governance and development collaboration. It will offer a detailed understanding of the evolving administrative landscape in Sri Lanka. In parallel, the project will explore the potential for simple, cost-effective digital tools&#x2014;such as decision-trackers and dashboards&#x2014;to support transparency and effective policy implementation. These efforts will be aligned with the UK High Commission&#x2019;s broader objectives, ensuring relevance and mutual benefit.</narrative>
  </description>
